        // is catching up again (balance rebuilds from the birthday), so the cue must
        // re-show during the rebuild; leaving everSynced set would make
        // `everSynced && lastSynced==null` ambiguous and suppress the reassurance
        // over a rebuilding balance on an offline relaunch. Contrast
