        // NEVER swept — a pending/abandoned OutOfZec quote's refund address never enters
        // the poll through the backfill (the §4.4 item-7 envelope: "enters the poll only
        // at EXECUTE"), and an executed swap never gets a synthetic `backfill:` twin row
